Source: pam-entra-sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Matchory GmbH <security@matchory.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12),
               libpam0g-dev,
               libcurl4-openssl-dev,
               nlohmann-json3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://github.com/matchory/pam-entra-sudo
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pam-entra-sudo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: PAM module for sudo via a fresh Entra ID passkey sign-in
 Authenticates sudo with the OAuth 2.0 device authorization grant against
 Microsoft Entra ID, requiring a new sign-in with a required method (such as
 a passkey) for every authentication.
